ue,"id":6290,"name":"G-angle"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"McDonald’s has partnered with legendary animation house Studio Pierrot to produce the first official WcDonald’s anime. Four episodic shorts will take fans into the flavourful world of WcDonald’s, where a story about the WcDonald’s Sauce and WcNuggets unfolds each week, The shorts will honor four of anime's biggest genres - Action, Romance, Mecha, and Fantasy.\n\nEpisodes:\n\n1) The Race to WcDonald’s: WcDonald’s Sauce has arrived, marking the moment everyone has eagerly anticipated. The announcement excites fans across the land, sparking an all-out, action-filled race between two strangers to be the first to experience this long-awaited delicacy. Find out who comes out on top in the race to WcDonald’s.\n\n2) Love from Across the Booth: Our two protagonists discover the WcDonald’s Sauce and WcNuggets aren’t the only perfect pairing. Just one glance… and just one dip… that’s all it takes for love to unfold. Kazuki and Shizuru must face their feelings in the second installment of WcDonald’s!\n\n3) WcNuggets Space Frontier 3000: On the Moon-Base WcDonald's, a space monster suddenly disrupts the balance with a growing hunger for WcNuggets. Assemble! The crew at the Moon-Base WcDonald’s is ready for action boarding the famous mecha WcDizer 3000. But can they keep the sauce safe from the Wakudon’s attack and tip the scales against this Class A monster?\n\n4) The Wisdom of the Sauce: During the final week of WcDonald’s Sauce, three friends meet to savor this occasion one last time, wishing this flavor never had to disappear. And that wish might just be granted as they’re transported to a distant, magical land, where they are challenged to seek the wisdom of the sage Kenja and keep the WcDonald’s Sauce. Will our heroes triumph in their quest?\n\n(Source: WcDonald's, Press Release, edited)"},"tags":[{"name":"Advertisement","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthology","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"WcDonald's","english":"WcDonald's","native":"ワクドナルド","romaji":"WcDonalds","synonyms":[]},"trailer":{"id":"DEKckUd310o","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DEKckUd310o/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}